  "html": "<h3>How to use this course</h3>\n      <p>This is built for every Base IB member, whether you have never heard the words \"Introducing Broker\" before, or you already have an audience and want to turn it into a real, durable income stream. Work through the modules in order the first time; after that, use the sidebar to jump straight to whatever you need.</p>\n      <p>A few sections carry a <span class=\"placeholder\">[bracketed placeholder]</span>, and that is exactly where your specific Base IB link, commission tiers, or sign up steps get dropped in. Everything else is the actual knowledge: how the model works, how to grow with it, and how to do it properly.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"callout\">\n        <span class=\"lbl\">What \"Base IB\" means</span>\n        <p>Base IB is our Introducing Broker network, the structure that lets members earn from the trading activity of people they refer, and from the Sub IB partners they bring in underneath them. It sits on top of our broker partnerships, currently IC Markets, PU Prime, and Vantage; Base IB is the network layer on top, not the brokers themselves.</p>\n      </div>"
