    "title": "Becoming a Base IB Partner",
    "minutes": 4,
    "html": "<p>This module is the on ramp. It is short by design; the goal is to get you correctly set up once, so every module after this compounds instead of getting undone by a setup mistake.</p>\n\n      <h3>Who this is for</h3>\n      <p>You do not need thousands of followers to start. You need three things: you are an active or recovering active trader who understands the product you are recommending, you are comfortable being visible (even a little), and you are willing to treat this like a real business, meaning consistency over weeks and months, not a single viral post.</p>\n\n      <h3>Onboarding checklist</h3>\n      <ul class=\"checklist\">\n        <li><input type=\"checkbox\"> <span class=\"li-text\">No eligibility criteria to meet: just sign up and fund your account with the <strong>£300 minimum deposit</strong></span></li>\n        <li><input type=\"checkbox\"> <span class=\"li-text\">Complete broker / partner registration with your chosen broker (IC Markets, PU Prime, or Vantage) <span class=\"placeholder\">[sign up link]</span></span></li>\n        <li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Verify identity (KYC) on the broker side, as required</li>\n        <li><input type=\"checkbox\"> <span class=\"li-text\">Receive and record your unique referral link or code <span class=\"placeholder\">[your link]</span></span></li>\n        <li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Log in to your IB dashboard and locate: clicks, sign ups, funded accounts, lots traded, commission earned</li>\n        <li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Read the broker's IB terms in full; know what you can and cannot say (Module 09)</li>\n        <li><input type=\"checkbox\"> Save your link somewhere permanent: bio links, pinned posts, saved Telegram message</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h3>Reading your dashboard</h3>\n      <p>Every serious IB program gives you a live dashboard. Learn it in week one, not month three. At minimum, you should be able to answer these four questions at any moment: how many people clicked my link this week, how many of those opened a funded account, how much volume are my referred traders generating, and what did I earn. If you cannot answer those four, you are flying blind; go find the dashboard screen that answers each one before you do anything else in this course.</p>\n\n      <h3>Our broker partners</h3>\n      <p>Base IB currently partners with three brokers: IC Markets, PU Prime, and Vantage. <strong>We recommend PU Prime by default</strong>: it is the broker walked through step by step below, so start new clients there unless they already trade elsewhere. Use your own sign up link for whichever broker a client picks. Whichever one a client ends up on, the same rule applies: their trading volume has to attach to your account, or none of this pays out.</p>\n\n      <h3>Navigating PU Prime</h3>\n      <p>The walkthrough below covers PU Prime specifically, since it is the most common starting point. IC Markets and Vantage follow a similar sign up and transfer process through their own apps. There are two different paths depending on whether someone is brand new to PU Prime or already has an account.</p>\n\n      <h4>Brand new to PU Prime</h4>\n      <p>They register through your personal referral link or referral code (both live on your IB dashboard, covered below). They land under you automatically the moment they sign up, no extra form needed.</p>\n\n      <h4>Already has a PU Prime account</h4>\n      <p>They do not need to open a second one. Instead they transfer their existing account's IB connection over to you. The account needs a minimum balance of £300 in it, and they must not open any new trades until the transfer has fully gone through: open positions or trading activity mid transfer can cause it to fail.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"shot-grid\">\n        <div class=\"shot\">\n          <div class=\"shot-step\">Step 1</div>\n          <img src=\"/playbook/becoming-a-base-ib-partner-1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"PU Prime app profile page with the Transfer IB/CPA option highlighted under Other\">\n          <div class=\"shot-cap\">From their profile page in the PU Prime app, under \"Other,\" they tap <strong>Transfer IB/CPA</strong>.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"shot\">\n          <div class=\"shot-step\">Step 2</div>\n          <img src=\"/playbook/becoming-a-base-ib-partner-2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"PU Prime transfer form with Partnership Type set to IB and a New CPA/IB field to fill in\">\n          <div class=\"shot-cap\">Partnership Type: <strong>IB</strong>. New CPA/IB: your rebate account number. They tick both confirmation boxes (positions closed, agree to transfer all trading accounts) and hit Submit.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p>A client account can only be connected to one affiliate at a time, so the transfer has to fully complete before anything else happens. If it is rejected or fails, it cannot be resubmitted for 72 hours, so get the details right the first time.</p>\n\n      <h4>Reading your PU Prime dashboard</h4>\n      <p>This is where everything lives: connecting new clients, tracking who is active, and moving what you have earned.</p>\n      <div class=\"tbl-wrap\">\n      <table>\n        <caption>Fields on your PU Prime IB dashboard</caption>\n        <thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>What it is</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Rebate Account number</td><td>Your unique IB number. It is what a client types into the \"New CPA/IB\" field when transferring an existing PU Prime account over to you.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Total Commission &amp; Available Balance</td><td>What you have earned and what is ready to move. Withdraw Rebate cashes it out; Transfer Rebate moves it elsewhere.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Referral Link</td><td>For anyone who does not already have a PU Prime account. They register through this link and land under you automatically, no transfer form needed.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Referral Code</td><td>A shorter version of the same thing, useful anywhere a full link does not fit: captions, bio, reading it out loud.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Clients &amp; balances</td><td>Scroll further down and you will see every client under you along with their account balances, so you can track who is active and follow up with anyone who has gone quiet.</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shot\" style=\"max-width:260px;\">\n        <img src=\"/playbook/becoming-a-base-ib-partner-3.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"PU Prime IB dashboard showing rebate account and commission balance at the top, and referral link and referral code just below\">\n        <div class=\"shot-cap\">Your rebate account and commission balance sit at the top; your referral link and referral code are just below.</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"callout grow\">\n        <span class=\"lbl\">Early mindset shift</span>\n        <p>Your first five referrals will feel like the hardest part of this whole course. They are not a distraction from \"the real work,\" they <em>are</em> the real work. You cannot teach Sub IB recruiting (Module 03) with credibility until you have personally referred people yourself.</p>\n      </div>"
