    "title": "The Sub IB Layer",
    "minutes": 2,
    "html": "<p>This is the module that separates a Base IB partner earning a modest side income from one running a real network. A <strong>Sub IB</strong> is someone <em>you</em> bring into the Base IB network who runs their own IB business underneath yours. They get their own link, their own dashboard, their own referred traders, and you earn an <strong>override commission</strong> on their network's activity, on top of your own direct commissions.</p>\n\n      <figure>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagram showing you at the top recruiting your own traders and two Sub IBs, with direct commission flowing up from your traders and override commission flowing up from each Sub IB's own traders.\">\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"arrowMain\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n              <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n            </marker>\n            <marker id=\"arrowGold\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n              <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"var(--accent)\"/>\n            </marker>\n          </defs>\n\n          <g font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"14\">\n            <rect x=\"280\" y=\"20\" width=\"200\" height=\"56\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/>\n            <text x=\"380\" y=\"43\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"700\">YOU</text>\n            <text x=\"380\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\".7\" font-size=\"12\">BASE IB PARTNER</text>\n\n            <rect x=\"30\" y=\"190\" width=\"190\" height=\"56\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/>\n            <text x=\"125\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"700\">YOUR TRADERS</text>\n            <text x=\"125\" y=\"231\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\".7\" font-size=\"12\">DIRECT REFERRALS</text>\n\n            <rect x=\"285\" y=\"190\" width=\"190\" height=\"56\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/>\n            <text x=\"380\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"700\">SUB IB A</text>\n            <text x=\"380\" y=\"231\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\".7\" font-size=\"12\">RUNS THEIR OWN LINK</text>\n\n            <rect x=\"540\" y=\"190\" width=\"190\" height=\"56\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/>\n            <text x=\"635\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"700\">SUB IB B</text>\n            <text x=\"635\" y=\"231\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\".7\" font-size=\"12\">RUNS THEIR OWN LINK</text>\n\n            <rect x=\"285\" y=\"345\" width=\"190\" height=\"50\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".7\"/>\n            <text x=\"380\" y=\"368\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\".85\" font-size=\"11\">SUB IB A's TRADERS</text>\n            <text x=\"380\" y=\"384\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\".55\" font-size=\"10\">THEIR REFERRALS</text>\n\n            <rect x=\"540\" y=\"345\" width=\"190\" height=\"50\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".7\"/>\n            <text x=\"635\" y=\"368\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\".85\" font-size=\"11\">SUB IB B's TRADERS</text>\n            <text x=\"635\" y=\"384\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\".55\" font-size=\"10\">THEIR REFERRALS</text>\n          </g>\n\n          <g stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\".8\">\n            <line x1=\"345\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"190\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowMain)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"360\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"190\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowMain)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"410\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"610\" y2=\"190\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowMain)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"360\" y1=\"246\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"345\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowMain)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"615\" y1=\"246\" x2=\"615\" y2=\"345\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowMain)\"/>\n          </g>\n          <text x=\"228\" y=\"128\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\".75\">you recruit</text>\n\n          <g stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\">\n            <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"405\" y2=\"76\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowGold)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"400\" y1=\"246\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"90\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowGold)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"655\" y1=\"246\" x2=\"435\" y2=\"90\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowGold)\"/>\n          </g>\n          <text x=\"205\" y=\"175\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--accent)\">direct commission</text>\n          <text x=\"420\" y=\"300\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--accent)\">override %</text>\n          <text x=\"500\" y=\"150\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"var(--accent)\">override %</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption>You earn direct commission from traders you refer yourself, plus an override commission from every Sub IB's network. The override compounds across every tier you build.</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <h3>Why this is the actual growth lever</h3>\n      <p>Your personal time to post content, message prospects, and follow up is finite. A Sub IB's time is not yours, but their production still pays you. Ten Sub IBs, each modestly active, will out earn one person grinding solo, every time. This is the same duplication principle behind every durable referral or affiliate network: your income scales with the size and activity of your <em>network</em>, not the size of your personal effort.</p>\n\n      <h3>Single tier vs deep networks</h3>\n      <p>Keep this simple at first. Focus on recruiting Sub IBs directly under you (one tier) until you have three to five consistently active ones. Only once you have proven you can support that many should you start coaching your best Sub IBs to recruit their own, because at that point you are not just building a network, you are training network builders, and quality control gets harder the deeper it goes.</p>\n\n      <h4>How this actually works inside PU Prime</h4>\n      <p>When you connect a Sub IB, you set their rate yourself, at whatever level you choose below your own. For example, if you earn $10 per lot, you might set them at $5 per lot instead. They earn on every client they bring in and get trading; you earn the gap between their rate and yours on top of every lot those clients trade, automatically, without doing any of the legwork yourself.</p>"
