    "html": "<p>One line per module, for whenever you need the reminder without rereading the whole thing.</p>\n      <ol class=\"quickref\">\n        <li><span><b>The IB Model.</b> You earn from trading volume, never from losses.</span></li>\n        <li><span><b>Becoming a Partner.</b> Get set up once, and learn your dashboard cold.</span></li>\n        <li><span><b>The Sub IB Layer.</b> You earn direct commission plus an override from every Sub IB's network.</span></li>\n        <li><span><b>Finding Traders.</b> Attract with value, earn trust, then invite.</span></li>\n        <li><span><b>Content &amp; Branding.</b> Rotate education, transparency, lifestyle, and community proof.</span></li>\n        <li><span><b>Converting Followers.</b> Ask, don't announce, and always leave one clear next step.</span></li>\n        <li><span><b>Scaling the Network.</b> Teach duplication, don't just add more yourself.</span></li>\n        <li><span><b>Tracking &amp; Metrics.</b> Five numbers, checked weekly, beat gut feel every time.</span></li>\n        <li><span><b>Compliance &amp; Ethics.</b> Disclose plainly, never guarantee returns, never pay for recruitment alone.</span></li>\n        <li><span><b>30 Day Action Plan.</b> Set up, first invites, first Sub IB, then review and repeat.</span></li>\n      </ol>"
